(7437959, 1175595, 34192, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. Like a masterful pen and ink. I love the serenity of it (I love boats, so that may help). I think this is really well taken, composed and edited. I''d love to see how you got it here. 10</td>', 'This is beautiful. Like a masterful pen and ink. I love the serenity of it (I love boats, so that may help). I think this is really well taken, composed and edited. I''d love to see how you got it here. 10', '2016-02-18 08:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
