(7438778, 1175823, 63218, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is a postcard from a parallel universe. At first, I thought ''those strange flowers look like skulls.'' Then, I realized they are skulls. Waugh! The distressed look hints that it''s a keepsake of some kind, from very long ago. I had a good time, imagining the story. Thanks!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1046796" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg"/></a> <br/>The Flying Pig Honorable Mention<br/>Please accept this Flying Pig HM in recognition for fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenge entries. Check out <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1171726&amp;highlight=flying%20pig&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">the Flying Pig thread</a> for other excellent comps &amp; comments.</td>', 'Wow! This is a postcard from a parallel universe. At first, I thought ''those strange flowers look like skulls.'' Then, I realized they are skulls. Waugh! The distressed look hints that it''s a keepsake of some kind, from very long ago. I had a good time, imagining the story. Thanks!  The Flying Pig Honorable MentionPlease accept this Flying Pig HM in recognition for fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenge entries. Check out the Flying Pig thread for other excellent comps & comments.', '2016-02-21 21:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438779, 1175106, 63218, '<td valign="top">Oh my, so much emotion in this. Mrs Bagley is the one with her left arm up, maybe, &amp; she has a face I''ve seen around here &amp; there. But Mrs Bagley could be the poor soul squashed in the corner too. Without the glitz &amp; glamour created by the advertising industry, this is our life. We are accompanied by small exotica that have no meaning.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1038123" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg"/></a> <br/>The Flying Pig Best in Show<br/> <br/>Please accept this Flying Pig in recognition for fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenge entries. Check out <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1171726&amp;highlight=flying%20pig&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">the Flying Pig thread</a> for other excellent comps &amp; comments.</td>', 'Oh my, so much emotion in this. Mrs Bagley is the one with her left arm up, maybe, & she has a face I''ve seen around here & there. But Mrs Bagley could be the poor soul squashed in the corner too. Without the glitz & glamour created by the advertising industry, this is our life. We are accompanied by small exotica that have no meaning.  The Flying Pig Best in Show Please accept this Flying Pig in recognition for fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenge entries. Check out the Flying Pig thread for other excellent comps & comments.', '2016-02-21 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438780, 1175766, 63218, '<td valign="top">Simple, &amp; effective &amp; GORGEOUS color abstract. Sometimes, after one flip it''s done.<br/>[ETA] I missed the twirl, which is cool, as the effect doesn''t dominate the comp. And I like the idea of combining images. Thanks for the inspiration!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1046796" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg"/></a> <br/>The Flying Pig Honorable Mention<br/>Please accept this Flying Pig HM in recognition for fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenge entries. Check out <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1171726&amp;highlight=flying%20pig&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">the Flying Pig thread</a> for other excellent comps &amp; comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-02-22 09:30:34.</i></td>', 'Simple, & effective & GORGEOUS color abstract. Sometimes, after one flip it''s done.[ETA] I missed the twirl, which is cool, as the effect doesn''t dominate the comp. And I like the idea of combining images. Thanks for the inspiration!  The Flying Pig Honorable MentionPlease accept this Flying Pig HM in recognition for fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenge entries. Check out the Flying Pig thread for other excellent comps & comments.', '2016-02-21 21:35:17.000000', '2016-02-22 09:30:34.000000', 1),
(7438782, 1175967, 63218, '<td valign="top">Good work, combining images turned the dress into air. The snow is wonderful, the lights are a nice little twist, there on the edge of the dark. The combination of colors creates a pensive <i></i>mood. Done perfectly, like a little poem.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1046796" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg"/></a> <br/>The Flying Pig Honorable Mention<br/>Please accept this Flying Pig HM in recognition for fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenge entries. Check out <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1171726&amp;highlight=flying%20pig&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">the Flying Pig thread</a> for other excellent comps &amp; comments.</td>', 'Good work, combining images turned the dress into air. The snow is wonderful, the lights are a nice little twist, there on the edge of the dark. The combination of colors creates a pensive mood. Done perfectly, like a little poem.  The Flying Pig Honorable MentionPlease accept this Flying Pig HM in recognition for fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenge entries. Check out the Flying Pig thread for other excellent comps & comments.', '2016-02-21 21:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438793, 1175050, 63218, '<td valign="top">I keep looking at this. I realized it was because of that green light that turns everything into an icon, including the moustache on the wall (?) &amp; the things in the window. I had fun wondering if the model is the photographer, &amp; if the room was set up for this shot. It is a delightful comp.</td>', 'I keep looking at this. I realized it was because of that green light that turns everything into an icon, including the moustache on the wall (?) & the things in the window. I had fun wondering if the model is the photographer, & if the room was set up for this shot. It is a delightful comp.', '2016-02-21 22:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
