(7439418, 1176004, 113016, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sempermarine:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MeMex2:</b></div><hr/><i> Great portrait Jeff. It seems that so many people want to know your technique and since The Godfather sent it to me, I thought I would share it.<br/>//wegraphics.net/blog/tutorials/photoshop-quick-tip-create-a-dragan-style-portrait-effect-in-5-steps/ </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m certainly familiar with "Dragan" style and have influences from it. I don''t follow any of those steps. I used "high pass" quite a bit in the past, but now I''ve found some other techniques that appeal to me. That''s the wonderful thing about this art form. So many different ways to get to a certain outcome.  <br/> <br/>Here is the original:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1176384" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89723/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1176384.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89723/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1176384.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89723/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1176384.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''d agree...I think over the past 4 years I''ve gone thru Dragan, Hollywood, Dewis, etc.  you''ve found a really nice combination!</td>', 'Originally posted by sempermarine: Originally posted by MeMex2: Great portrait Jeff. It seems that so many people want to know your technique and since The Godfather sent it to me, I thought I would share it.//wegraphics.net/blog/tutorials/photoshop-quick-tip-create-a-dragan-style-portrait-effect-in-5-steps/   I''m certainly familiar with "Dragan" style and have influences from it. I don''t follow any of those steps. I used "high pass" quite a bit in the past, but now I''ve found some other techniques that appeal to me. That''s the wonderful thing about this art form. So many different ways to get to a certain outcome.   Here is the original:    I''d agree...I think over the past 4 years I''ve gone thru Dragan, Hollywood, Dewis, etc.  you''ve found a really nice combination!', '2016-02-24 23:50:08.000000', NULL, 0),
